  "description": "At HelloFresh, we're of the opinion that there is no excuse for boring bits in a salad. Delicious veggies should never be a chore to tuck into – especially not when there is so much lovely produce coming into season right now. Marinated red and golden veggies are imbued with a delicious sharpness, perfect against smoky barbeque tofu and creamy fetta. Say no to boring salads and get a load of this on your fork!",
