  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced. To prepare the ingredients, cut the sweet potato (unpeeled) and red capsicum into 2 cm chuncks. Cut the tomato and red onion into wedges, and cut the tofu into cubes. Peel and crush the garlic. Crumble the fetta cheese and pick the parsley leaves."
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the sweet potato, tomato wedges, red onion and red capsicum on a lined oven tray. Combine the olive oil, garlic and red wine vinegar in a small bowl or jug. Pour the oil mixture over the vegetables and toss to coat well. Season well with salt and pepper. Cook in the oven for 30-35 minutes or until the veggies begin to turn golden.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/563ac4b2f8b25e8b048b4567/step_56494dcc9da1a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the Korean BBQ tofu to another lined oven tray. Cook in the same oven for 10 minutes. Turn the tofu over and cook for a further 10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/563ac4b2f8b25e8b048b4567/step_56494dccbbc0e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss the tofu cubes with the rocket leaves, roast vegetables, fetta cheese and parsley leaves. Drizzle with extra olive oil if you like."
    }
  ]
